<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SunSqueeze Lemonade</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --acid-yellow: #E2FF00;
            --dark-bg: #111111;
            --text-light: #FFFFFF;
            --pink-accent: #FF007A;
            --green-accent: #00E676;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            background-color: var(--acid-yellow);
            color: #000;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #000;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background-color: var(--acid-yellow);
            color: #000;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px 120px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 6rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #000;
            color: #000;
        }

        /* Flavor Cards Section */
        .flavors {
            padding: 60px 40px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .flavors h2 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--acid-yellow);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #1A1A1A;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            min-height: 380px;
        }

        .card.yellow { border-color: var(--acid-yellow); }
        .card.pink { border-color: var(--pink-accent); }
        .card.green { border-color: var(--green-accent); }

        .badge {
            align-self: flex-start;
            background: #333;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #AAA;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .card-btn {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }

        /* Founders */
        .founders {
            background-color: var(--acid-yellow);
            color: #000;
            padding: 80px 40px;
        }

        .founders h2 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .founder-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .founder-card {
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .founder-card h3 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--acid-yellow);
        }

        .role {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
        }

        blockquote {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">SUNSQUEEZE</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#flavors">Flavors</a>
            <a href="#founders">Founders</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Squeeze<br>The Sun</h1>
        <p>Hyper-squeezed citrus engineered by Aminu Ammar & Abdurrahman Aminu. Pure voltage in a bottle.</p>
        <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="btn">Taste The Sting</button>
            <button class="btn btn-outline">Meet The Founders</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="flavors" id="flavors">
        <h2>Pick Your Voltage</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card yellow">
                <div>
                    <span class="badge" style="background:var(--acid-yellow); color:#000;">THE OG STING</span>
                    <h3>SunSqueeze Lemonade</h3>
                    <p>Sun-ripened lemons squeezed into pure electric refreshment. The one that started the squeeze.</p>
                </div>
                <button class="card-btn" style="background:var(--acid-yellow); color:#000;">+ Squeeze to Cart</button>
            </div>

            <div class="card pink">
                <div>
                    <span class="badge" style="background:var(--pink-accent); color:#fff;">COMING SOON</span>
                    <h3>Berrylade</h3>
                    <p>Wild berry body-slammed into fresh lemonade. Sweet meets sting.</p>
                </div>
                <button class="card-btn" style="background:#333; color:#777;">Coming Soon</button>
            </div>

            <div class="card green">
                <div>
                    <span class="badge" style="background:var(--green-accent); color:#000;">COMING SOON</span>
                    <h3>Mint Lemonade</h3>
                    <p>Cool crushed mint folded into sharp lemonade. Crisp, cold, and electric.</p>
                </div>
                <button class="card-btn" style="background:#333; color:#777;">Coming Soon</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="founders" id="founders">
        <h2>The Architects of Flavor</h2>
        <div class="founder-grid">
            <div class="founder-card">
                <h3>Aminu Ammar</h3>
                <span class="role">CO-FOUNDER & CEO • AGE 13</span>
                <blockquote>"We didn't make a drink. We bottled the exact moment a lemon hits water. Everything else is just juice."</blockquote>
            </div>

            <div class="founder-card">
                <h3>Abdurrahman Aminu</h3>
                <span class="role">CO-FOUNDER & CEO • AGE 11</span>
                <blockquote>"Refreshment should sting a little. If it doesn't bite back, it isn't SunSqueeze."</blockquote>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
